source: tests/sync/write_lib.rs
expression: apply(&switch)
---
## Switch

```
branches:
  - link (or)
  - rustdoc (xor) env_flags=["rust_curse_rustdoc"]
  - wasm (xor) cargo_features=["wasm"]
```

## Output

### lib.rs

```rust
#[cfg(not(any(feature = "wasm", rust_curse_rustdoc)))]
#[path = "link.rs"]
mod link;

#[cfg(rust_curse_rustdoc)]
#[path = "rustdoc.rs"]
mod rustdoc;

#[cfg(feature = "wasm")]
#[path = "wasm.rs"]
mod wasm;
```

### link.rs

```rust
// link
```

### rustdoc.rs

```rust
// rustdoc
```

### wasm.rs

```rust
// wasm
